54a3\" title=\"17-df-quantifier-elimination\">17-df-quantifier-elimination</a>，允许无用自由变量；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FreeVar}\">\\(\\mathrm{FreeVar}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{QFForm}\">\\(\\mathrm{QFForm}\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_T\">\\(\\equiv_T\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"58507ea1921a657e\" href=\"?note=58507ea1921a657e\" title=\"17-df-free-variable\">17-df-free-variable</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"e272cfe8553473c0\" href=\"?note=e272cfe8553473c0\" title=\"17-df-quantifier-free-formula\">17-df-quantifier-free-formula</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"31cb5bc79934e98e\" href=\"?note=31cb5bc79934e98e\" title=\"17-df-formula-consequence\">17-df-formula-consequence</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\operatorname{QE}_{L_{&lt;}}(T_{\\mathrm{DLO}}),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Form}_{L_{&lt;}}\\;\n\\bigl[\\mathrm{FreeVar}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{v_i:i&lt;n\\}\\to\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\exists\\psi\\in\\mathrm{QFForm}_{L_{&lt;}}\\;\n(\\mathrm{FreeVar}(\\psi)\\subseteq\\{v_i:i&lt;n\\}\\land\\varphi\\equiv_{T_{\\mathrm{DLO}}}\\psi)\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\operatorname{QE}_{L_{&lt;}}(T_{\\mathrm{DLO}}),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Form}_{L_{&lt;}}\\;\n\\bigl[\\mathrm{FreeVar}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{v_i:i&lt;n\\}\\to\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\exists\\psi\\in\\mathrm{QFForm}_{L_{&lt;}}\\;\n(\\mathrm{FreeVar}(\\psi)\\subseteq\\{v_i:i&lt;n\\}\\land\\varphi\\equiv_{T_{\\mathrm{DLO}}}\\psi)\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对应原书 Theorem 1.5.3；pp.51–53 的证明已读。有限个变量的等式/严格序型给出有限析取范式。消去一个存在变量时，等式分支可代入；严格上下界分支由稠密性及无端点性实现；无剩余变量时可返回恒真 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_0=v_0\">\\(v_0=v_0\\)</span> 或恒假 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg(v_0=v_0)\">\\(\\neg(v_0=v_0)\\)</span>。<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"139e6d72c7a59015\" href=\"?note=139e6d72c7a59015\" title=\"17-lem-quantifier-elimination-test\">17-lem-quantifier-elimination-test</a> 完成结构归纳。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"17-df-dense-linear-order","status":"resolved","id":"82293682c9179b16","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-dense-linear-order]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-quantifier-elimination","status":"resolved","id":"e318e28bff8754a3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-quantifier-elimination]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-lem-quantifier-elimination-test","status":"resolved","id":"139e6d72c7a59015","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-lem-quantifier-elimination-test]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-free-variable","status":"resolved","id":"58507ea1921a657e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-free-variable]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-quantifier-free-formula","status":"resolved","id":"e272cfe8553473c0","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-quantifier-free-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-formula-consequence","status":"resolved","id":"31cb5bc79934e98e","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-formula-consequence]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-formula","status":"resolved","